# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

menu "Stone OS"

config STONE
    bool "Stone OS fork additions"
    default y
    help
      Master switch for everything this fork adds on top of upstream
      PebbleOS. Every fork-local feature depends on it, so turning it
      off builds firmware that is functionally upstream — useful for
      bisecting a bug against stock behaviour without unwinding the
      patch queue.

      See docs/stone/index.md for the fork's conventions.

endmenu
